<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ktml version="0.1">

<head>
  <title>日付と時間</title>
  <id>76b22540-5e9c-404c-8aa4-3507ae344900</id>
  <created>2022-07-15T17:58:28+09:00</created>
  <modified>2022-07-15T18:07:21+09:00</modified>
</head>

<body>
  <h2>日時を表示</h2>
  <blockcode lang="bash"><![CDATA[$ date
Fri Jul 15 18:05:00 JST 2022]]></blockcode>

  <h2>タイムゾーンの変更</h2>
  <p><code lang="bash"><![CDATA[timedatectl set-timezone]]></code>でタイムゾーンを変更する。タイムゾーンの一覧は<code lang="bash"><![CDATA[timedatectl list-timezones]]></code>で得られる。</p>
  <blockcode lang="bash"><![CDATA[$ timedatectl
                Local time: Fri 2022-07-15 03:11:18 UTC
            Universal time: Fri 2022-07-15 03:11:18 UTC
                  RTC time: Fri 2022-07-15 03:11:19
                Time zone: Etc/UTC (UTC, +0000)
System clock synchronized: yes
              NTP service: active
          RTC in local TZ: no
$ timedatectl list-timezones | grep -i tokyo
Asia/Tokyo
$ sudo timedatectl set-timezone Asia/Tokyo
$ timedatectl
                Local time: Fri 2022-07-15 12:12:24 JST
            Universal time: Fri 2022-07-15 03:12:24 UTC
                  RTC time: Fri 2022-07-15 03:12:25
                Time zone: Asia/Tokyo (JST, +0900)
System clock synchronized: yes
              NTP service: active
          RTC in local TZ: no
]]></blockcode>
</body>

</ktml>